#: data/levels.json:three_freezers
msgid ""
"Dani's flat is empty, apart from three chest freezers. The heart after their name means they are keepsakes: you can move them, but never sell them. They already count as storage.\n"
"\n"
"Every other need on the bar is still a cross. Each one ticks as soon as the flat has a piece that provides it: a bed to sleep in, a toilet or a sink to wash, a stove to cook on, a desk to work at and a chair to sit on. The catalogue opens on what is still missing, and there is room and money for all of it.\n"
"\n"
"Short on floor anyway? A Loft Bed sleeps above head height, and the low freezers fit under it."
msgstr ""

#: data/tenants/three_freezers.tres
msgid "And an oven. The pizzas will not bake themselves."
msgstr ""

